<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@700&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<section class="faq-nail">
  <div class="faq-nail__inner">
    <h2 class="faq-nail__title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h2>
    <p class="faq-nail__subtitle">Still unsure? Here’s what pet parents usually ask before trimming.</p>

    <div class="faq-nail__list">
      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Does this work on cats?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">Yes. It works on both cats and dogs. For cats, gently press the paw pad to extend the claw, check the nail with the LED light, then trim only the tip.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>What about very dark nails?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">The LED light helps improve visibility on dark nails, but how clearly you can see the quick varies from nail to nail. When you're unsure, clip a little less and use the grinder to smooth the rest gradually.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Is it safe if I’m nervous about cutting the quick?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">It's designed to help you trim with more confidence: the light and magnifier let you check the nail before every cut. Take it slowly, trim small amounts at a time, and finish with the grinder instead of cutting close.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Can I use the grinder only?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">Yes. If your pet doesn't like clippers, you can use the grinder on its own to shorten and smooth nails little by little. It takes a bit longer but gives you more control.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Does it catch nail clippings?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">Yes. The built-in debris catcher collects clippings as you trim, so there's less mess to clean up. Empty it after each session.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Is the grinder loud?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">The grinder makes a gentle humming sound. If your pet is sensitive to noise, turn it on near them for a few seconds before you start so they get used to the sound.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>Can I use it for large and small pets?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">Yes. It's suitable for small, medium and large dogs as well as cats. For very thick nails, trim small amounts and use the grinder to finish.</div>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-nail__item">
        <summary>How do I charge it?</summary>
        <div class="faq-nail__answer">Charge it with the included USB-C cable. No batteries needed.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  body { overflow-x: clip; }
  .faq-nail {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    padding: 56px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .faq-nail__inner {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .faq-nail__title {
    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 60px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: .5px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #1f1f1f;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .faq-nail__subtitle {
    font-size: 17px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0 0 44px;
  }
  .faq-nail__item {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    border: 1px solid #edf2ef;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .faq-nail__item summary {
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    padding: 18px 56px 18px 22px;
    background: #f7fdfa;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }
  .faq-nail__item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-nail__item summary::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    right: 24px;
    top: 50%;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-right: 1.6px solid #333;
    border-bottom: 1.6px solid #333;
    transform: translateY(-70%) rotate(45deg);
    transition: transform .2s ease;
  }
  .faq-nail__item[open] summary::after {
    transform: translateY(-30%) rotate(-135deg);
  }
  .faq-nail__item[open] summary { border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2ef; }
  .faq-nail__answer {
    padding: 16px 22px 18px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555;
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .faq-nail { padding: 40px 16px; }
    .faq-nail__title { font-size: 38px; }
    .faq-nail__subtitle { font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .faq-nail__item summary { font-size: 16px; padding: 16px 46px 16px 16px; }
    .faq-nail__item summary::after { right: 18px; }
    .faq-nail__answer { font-size: 15px; padding: 14px 16px 16px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    // Mở một câu thì tự đóng các câu khác
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-nail__list').forEach(function (list) {
      if (list.dataset.bound) return;
      list.dataset.bound = '1';
      list.querySelectorAll('details').forEach(function (d) {
        d.addEventListener('toggle', function () {
          if (!d.open) return;
          list.querySelectorAll('details[open]').forEach(function (o) { if (o !== d) o.open = false; });
        });
      });
    });

    function fit() {
      var vw = document.documentElement.clientWidth;
      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-nail').forEach(function (el) {
        el.style.width = vw + 'px';
        el.style.marginLeft = '0px';
        // Lặp vài lần để căn đúng giữa màn hình dù khung cha của theme lệch hay co giãn
        for (var i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
          var left = el.getBoundingClientRect().left;
          if (Math.abs(left) < 0.5) break;
          el.style.marginLeft = (parseFloat(el.style.marginLeft) - left) + 'px';
        }
      });
    }
    fit();
    window.addEventListener('load', fit);
    window.addEventListener('resize', fit);
    document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load', fit);
  })();
</script>
